{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>天文台預測，本港周日（29日）天晴乾燥，相對濕度45-70%，早上市區最低氣溫約20°C，新界再低兩三度，日間最高氣溫約24°C。晚上部分時間多雲。吹和緩東北風，明日東風逐漸增強。展望隨後一兩日大致天晴。下周中後期日間相當溫暖。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:37:44.990050+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:44:04.404964+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:30:56.028802+00:00","content_hash":"dd928bce1367a44a30daae6f5e8a994b863965c5af9437df98f14f246653cb55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}